  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1374",
    "issue_date": "2026-09-19T02:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-19T02:01:36.951Z",
    "meteorologist": "Rojan Lamichhane",
    "analysis_np": "हाल देशभर मनसुनी वायुको साथै पश्चिमी वायुको पनि आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ। मनसुनको न्यून चापीय रेखा भने सरदर स्थानको दक्षिणतर्फ रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "Currently, the entire country is under the influence of monsoon winds, along with a partial influence of westerly winds. The monsoon trough is currently located south of its normal position.",
    "today_np": "देशभर साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ।  कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली भू-भागका केही स्थानमा तथा लुुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। देशका पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । देशको तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्म वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी  प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ |",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions will prevail across the country. Moderate rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at some places in the Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces, and at a few places in the Himalayan regions of Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Moderate rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at some places in the hilly regions of the country. Moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at a few places in the Terai regions of the country. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल तथा तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र कर्णाली प्रदेशका हिमाली भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा लुुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा कर्णाली र सुदुरपश्चिम प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्म वर्षाको सम्भावना छ।  देशको तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्म वर्षाको सम्भावना छ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and hilly regions of the country, while partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Terai regions. Moderate rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at a few places in the Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, and Karnali Provinces, and at one or two places in the Himalayan regions of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at a few places in the hilly regions of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, and Lumbini Provinces, and at one or two places in the hilly regions of Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at one or two places in the Terai regions of the country.",
    "special": ""
  }
